Our changes to dime-online/qwen3.8-Flash-DGX-UltraFast at commit 0c391a3 (Apache-2.0). serve.sh applies them with
`git apply`; git ignores this text before the first diff.

- recipe/config/v16b/env: listen on loopback only (as shipped, the server is published on every interface), serve the
  model as "qwen3.8-flash-next" instead of "qwen", and name the container "qwen3.8-flash-next" so that starting it
  never removes an existing "qwen38-flash" container from an unpatched checkout.
- recipe/config/v16b/serve.sh and launch.sh: if SANDBOX_PORT is set, publish the server there too. serve.sh sets it to
  the gateway of OpenShell's Docker bridge, so that the OpenShell sandbox reaches the server; that address is not
  reachable from the network.
- recipe/build/model/build.sh: run the three CPU test gates from /tmp. They write a scratch file into their working
  directory, which is the read-only /work mount, so `build.sh --run` fails with "Read-only file system" as shipped.

diff --git a/recipe/build/model/build.sh b/recipe/build/model/build.sh
index cc26df3..ea6e238 100755
--- a/recipe/build/model/build.sh
+++ b/recipe/build/model/build.sh
@@ -24,6 +24,12 @@ docker_common=(docker run --rm --network none --memory 8g --ipc=host
   --user "$(id -u):$(id -g)" -e PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1
   -v "$here:/work:ro" -v "$models_root:/models" -w /work
   --entrypoint python3 "$image")
+# The CPU test gates write a scratch file into their working directory, and /work is mounted read-only, so they run
+# from /tmp. The build and verify steps are unchanged.
+docker_tests=(docker run --rm --network none --memory 8g --ipc=host
+  --user "$(id -u):$(id -g)" -e PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1
+  -v "$here:/work:ro" -v "$models_root:/models" -w /tmp
+  --entrypoint python3 "$image")
 build_args=(/work/build_int4side_model_dir.py --tier drafter-dense --group-size 32
   --model-dir "/models/$base" --out-dir "/models/$output")
 verify_args=(/work/build_int4side_model_dir.py --tier drafter-dense --group-size 32
@@ -49,9 +55,9 @@ printf '%s  %s\n' \
   echo 'base checkpoint does not match the pinned public inputs' >&2; exit 65;
 }
 
-"${docker_common[@]}" /work/test_rtn_int4_gptq.py
-"${docker_common[@]}" /work/test_build_int4side.py
-"${docker_common[@]}" /work/test_build_mtpdense.py
+"${docker_tests[@]}" /work/test_rtn_int4_gptq.py
+"${docker_tests[@]}" /work/test_build_int4side.py
+"${docker_tests[@]}" /work/test_build_mtpdense.py
 "${docker_common[@]}" "${build_args[@]}"
 "${docker_common[@]}" "${verify_args[@]}"
 
